{'symbol': 'EQT', 'date': '2020-01-03 10:30:00', 'title': 'EQT NAMES DAVID KHANI AS CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER', 'text': "EQT NAMES DAVID KHANI AS CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER.EQT CORP - APPOINTED DAVID KHANI AS CFO, EFFECTIVE JAN 3.EQT CORP - KYLE DERHAM, WHO HAS BEEN SERVING AS CO'S INTERIM CFO, WILL REMAIN WITH EQT IN AN EXECUTIVE ADVISORY ROLE TO ENSURE TRANSITION.EQT CORP - DERHAM WILL ASSIST IN EXECUTION OF EQT'S STRATEGIC INITIATIVES BEFORE RETURNING TO HIS ROLE AS PARTNER OF RICE INVESTMENT GROUP."}